1
00:01:33,990 --> 00:01:37,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Sasuke's Story: Sunrise,</i>
<i>Part 3: Fuushin</i></b></font>

2
00:01:48,860 --> 00:01:49,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is that?!</b></font>

3
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:51,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Get away from him!</b></font>

4
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:01,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So that's the Sharingan.</b></font>

5
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:10,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What a surprise.</b></font>

6
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:15,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke using his Sharingan
to save someone's life…</b></font>

7
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:17,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?</b></font>

8
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>W-Watch out!</b></font>

9
00:02:24,820 --> 00:02:25,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What happened?!</b></font>

10
00:02:28,780 --> 00:02:30,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lady Himeyuri!</b></font>

11
00:02:30,860 --> 00:02:33,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just what is going on?</b></font>

12
00:02:34,990 --> 00:02:36,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Leave one of them to me!</b></font>

13
00:02:37,650 --> 00:02:39,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We can't save them…</b></font>

14
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:41,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but we can lessen the damage!</b></font>

15
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How bothersome.</b></font>

16
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:25,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chino!</b></font>

17
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is it?</b></font>

18
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:47,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I didn't expect you to save me…
Sasuke dear.</b></font>

19
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

20
00:03:52,780 --> 00:03:53,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Chino!</b></font>

21
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you okay?</b></font>

22
00:03:58,030 --> 00:04:00,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm fine, I'm fine... Ow!</b></font>

23
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You need to get that taken care of.</b></font>

24
00:04:05,650 --> 00:04:08,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They're the Exploding Humans that
attacked the Hidden Leaf Village.</b></font>

25
00:04:10,110 --> 00:04:11,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They're quite troublesome.</b></font>

26
00:04:16,110 --> 00:04:20,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can't make contact with him,
so I'm going to get going.</b></font>

27
00:04:21,990 --> 00:04:24,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Looks like you won't get
to meet Oyashiro.</b></font>

28
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:26,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What?</b></font>

29
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:29,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I told you, didn't I?
He's a very cautious man.</b></font>

30
00:04:31,570 --> 00:04:36,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can't imagine he'd stick around
after all this uproar.</b></font>

31
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And since the match
ended midway,</b></font>

32
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:42,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>there won't be an ID tag
transfer ceremony either.</b></font>

33
00:04:43,200 --> 00:04:47,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Besides, we won't be able
to get any intel on Fuushin,</b></font>

34
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:49,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who belonged to
Oyashiro's former guard unit,</b></font>

35
00:04:49,740 --> 00:04:52,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who's making all
these Exploding Humans.</b></font>

36
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:55,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This has been
a total waste of time.</b></font>

37
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:01,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lord Orochimaru.</b></font>

38
00:05:06,610 --> 00:05:07,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What did you say?</b></font>

39
00:05:08,450 --> 00:05:09,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke…</b></font>

40
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:12,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oyashiro is asking for you.</b></font>

41
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:15,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Go on ahead.</b></font>

42
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:16,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What about you?</b></font>

43
00:05:16,990 --> 00:05:20,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm going to get
this wound looked at.</b></font>

44
00:05:20,610 --> 00:05:22,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll stick with Chino.</b></font>

45
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right.</b></font>

46
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:42,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh, hello!</b></font>

47
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:44,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I am En Oyashiro.</b></font>

48
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:46,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Nice to meet you!</b></font>

49
00:05:51,070 --> 00:05:54,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is he really En Oyashiro?</b></font>

50
00:05:54,530 --> 00:05:56,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There's no mistake.</b></font>

51
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:02,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's been a long time,
Mr. Orochimaru!</b></font>

52
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:07,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>When was the last time
we were face to face like this?</b></font>

53
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:12,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's been so long,
I don't remember.</b></font>

54
00:06:12,820 --> 00:06:15,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's going on?</b></font>

55
00:06:16,110 --> 00:06:17,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't recall you
being someone</b></font>

56
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:21,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who'd reveal himself so casually
before others like this.</b></font>

57
00:06:23,030 --> 00:06:25,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's only because I witnessed
something very interesting.</b></font>

58
00:06:28,570 --> 00:06:32,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Though it was quite a shock to
see humans explode like that.</b></font>

59
00:06:33,070 --> 00:06:35,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They're just like
the Exploding Humans</b></font>

60
00:06:35,860 --> 00:06:37,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>that attacked
the Hidden Leaf, right?</b></font>

61
00:06:37,780 --> 00:06:38,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You know about that?</b></font>

62
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:41,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You can't be in
my line of business</b></font>

63
00:06:41,150 --> 00:06:43,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>if you're not on top of the news.</b></font>

64
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:48,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They appeared because
they were after you, right?</b></font>

65
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:55,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Perhaps, this time.</b></font>

66
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:57,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This time?</b></font>

67
00:06:58,650 --> 00:07:00,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you saying that they attacked
the Hidden Leaf Village</b></font>

68
00:07:00,950 --> 00:07:02,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>for a different purpose?</b></font>

69
00:07:03,950 --> 00:07:06,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I mean, doesn't it seem like it?</b></font>

70
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:11,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>They attacked the Hidden Leaf Village</i>
<i>with me as their target?</i></b></font>

71
00:07:16,820 --> 00:07:19,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The man creating
the Exploding Humans</b></font>

72
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:21,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>seems to be a former member
of your guard unit.</b></font>

73
00:07:21,650 --> 00:07:23,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? No way!</b></font>

74
00:07:23,490 --> 00:07:24,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>His name is Fuushin.</b></font>

75
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:25,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You know him, don't you?</b></font>

76
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:29,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hmm… That kid?</b></font>

77
00:07:29,950 --> 00:07:32,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He initially belonged to someone else.</b></font>

78
00:07:32,450 --> 00:07:33,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Someone else?</b></font>

79
00:07:33,900 --> 00:07:37,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won him at the Coliseum and
assigned him to my guard unit.</b></font>

80
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:41,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I believe he was born on
a small island in the Land of Water.</b></font>

81
00:07:41,820 --> 00:07:44,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>When he was young,</b></font>

82
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:47,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>he was sold off by the islanders
because they were scared of him.</b></font>

83
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:48,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sold off?</b></font>

84
00:07:49,530 --> 00:07:52,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Isn't that how it is with
the Kekkei Genkai?</b></font>

85
00:07:53,820 --> 00:07:58,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Weak humans who
consider themselves "normal"</b></font>

86
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:00,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>always fear unusual power.</b></font>

87
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:04,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's a disadvantage from
the moment you manifest it.</b></font>

88
00:08:06,610 --> 00:08:10,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Though personally,
I like Kekkei Genkai.</b></font>

89
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:15,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I mean, they're powerful and rare!</b></font>

90
00:08:15,150 --> 00:08:18,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's why I've collected
all different kinds for my guard unit.</b></font>

91
00:08:19,740 --> 00:08:22,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I've even slaughtered the rest</b></font>

92
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:25,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and left only one to
increase the rarity…</b></font>

93
00:08:27,780 --> 00:08:28,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The only thing is,</b></font>

94
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:31,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>because of the difficult situations
surrounding their upbringing,</b></font>

95
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>many of the kids were rebellious.</b></font>

96
00:08:33,610 --> 00:08:35,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If I didn't know Medical Ninjutsu,</b></font>

97
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:38,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I probably couldn't
have tamed them.</b></font>

98
00:08:38,490 --> 00:08:41,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fuushin was a relatively good kid,</b></font>

99
00:08:41,860 --> 00:08:45,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but one day out of the blue,
he took the other kids and ran away.</b></font>

100
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:48,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I wonder why he ran away?</b></font>

101
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:53,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I fed them every day and
even gave them an allowance.</b></font>

102
00:08:53,610 --> 00:08:54,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I've heard enough!</b></font>

103
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:57,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Did Fuushin have red eyes?</b></font>

104
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:00,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Red eyes?</b></font>

105
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh, now that you mention it…</b></font>

106
00:09:07,530 --> 00:09:11,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>One of the kids who ran away with
Fuushin had eyes like that.</b></font>

107
00:09:11,650 --> 00:09:13,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ran away with Fuushin?</b></font>

108
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:16,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>So Fuushin has a partner?</i></b></font>

109
00:09:16,570 --> 00:09:18,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Was that Genjutsu Trap</i>
<i>his doing?</i></b></font>

110
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What was his name?</b></font>

111
00:09:22,990 --> 00:09:23,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I've forgotten.</b></font>

112
00:09:23,950 --> 00:09:25,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then remember.</b></font>

113
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're so harsh!</b></font>

114
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh, I know!</b></font>

115
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:33,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That kid was from the Chinoike Clan.</b></font>

116
00:09:33,950 --> 00:09:35,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Chinoike Clan?</b></font>

117
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:37,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What is that?</b></font>

118
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:39,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's a tragic story.</b></font>

119
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:42,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't care, tell me.</b></font>

120
00:09:43,490 --> 00:09:45,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It goes way back…</b></font>

121
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:51,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Even before the time Hashirama Senju
and Madara Uchiha competed for power.</b></font>

122
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Bloodshot eyes…</b></font>

123
00:09:55,950 --> 00:09:58,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Chinoike Clan with
their Ketsuryugan.</b></font>

124
00:09:59,650 --> 00:10:02,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They lived in
the Land of Lightning.</b></font>

125
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:04,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They were especially proficient
with genjutsu</b></font>

126
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and once you were caught
in their Visual Jutsu,</b></font>

127
00:10:06,950 --> 00:10:09,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>it was said
you could never escape.</b></font>

128
00:10:10,530 --> 00:10:12,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Anyway, one of the Chinoike Clan
women was sent</b></font>

129
00:10:12,950 --> 00:10:17,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>to become the concubine of
the feudal lord of the Land of Lightning.</b></font>

130
00:10:18,450 --> 00:10:21,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>She was personable and beautiful…</b></font>

131
00:10:22,610 --> 00:10:24,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and that made the lord's consort
terribly jealous.</b></font>

132
00:10:27,740 --> 00:10:31,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Unfortunately, shortly after taking
the girl as his concubine,</b></font>

133
00:10:31,450 --> 00:10:34,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the feudal lord became ill and died.</b></font>

134
00:10:36,110 --> 00:10:38,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"It's her fault he died!"</b></font>

135
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:42,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The lord's consort put all
the blame on the concubine.</b></font>

136
00:10:44,900 --> 00:10:49,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And those who knew about
the Chinoike Clan's unusual genetics,</b></font>

137
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:52,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>supported the consort's claim.</b></font>

138
00:10:55,530 --> 00:10:58,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As a result, the girl and
her entire clan</b></font>

139
00:10:58,530 --> 00:11:00,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>was exiled to a place known
as Hell Valley.</b></font>

140
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:04,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And for that, the consort hired…</b></font>

141
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:06,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What's the matter?</b></font>

142
00:11:08,950 --> 00:11:10,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Uchiha Clan.</b></font>

143
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:13,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What did you say?</b></font>

144
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:18,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Uchiha Clan with their Sharingan
were the only ones</b></font>

145
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who could go up against
the Chinoike Clan</b></font>

146
00:11:20,530 --> 00:11:23,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and their unique Visual Jutsu.</b></font>

147
00:11:24,030 --> 00:11:28,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Chinoike asked the Uchiha to set up
a meeting place to negotiate,</b></font>

148
00:11:28,150 --> 00:11:30,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but were rejected.</b></font>

149
00:11:31,780 --> 00:11:36,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Seems the Uchiha Clan who suffered
long through persecution</b></font>

150
00:11:36,650 --> 00:11:39,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>were also complicit in
the persecution of others.</b></font>

151
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:42,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What about Itachi?</b></font>

152
00:11:44,530 --> 00:11:46,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Was Itachi aware of this?</b></font>

153
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:48,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I wonder…</b></font>

154
00:11:49,950 --> 00:11:50,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However…</b></font>

155
00:11:51,450 --> 00:11:55,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>you may learn something
if you go to Hell Valley.</b></font>

156
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:02,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where is Hell Valley located?</b></font>

157
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:05,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's in the Land of Steam.</b></font>

158
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you going?</b></font>

159
00:12:11,490 --> 00:12:12,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I don't know.</b></font>

160
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:13,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I guess not.</b></font>

161
00:12:13,990 --> 00:12:16,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You don't know if Fuushin
is actually there.</b></font>

162
00:12:17,610 --> 00:12:20,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But I'm rooting for you.
Good luck!</b></font>

163
00:12:21,530 --> 00:12:25,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We need to get rid of nuisances like
Exploding Humans as soon as possible.</b></font>

164
00:12:26,530 --> 00:12:27,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's unusual.</b></font>

165
00:12:27,990 --> 00:12:31,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I didn't expect to hear that from
a weapons trader like yourself.</b></font>

166
00:12:32,030 --> 00:12:34,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If a convenient explosive like
that became commonplace,</b></font>

167
00:12:34,700 --> 00:12:38,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'd be forced to shut down
my business.</b></font>

168
00:13:00,070 --> 00:13:01,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just as guilty…</b></font>

169
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:03,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's what you said.</b></font>

170
00:13:03,650 --> 00:13:04,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?</b></font>

171
00:13:05,990 --> 00:13:10,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>To a victim, the assailant and</i>
<i>a third party are no different.</i></b></font>

172
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:15,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>People are no better than the assailant</i>
<i>if they didn't try to help.</i></b></font>

173
00:13:16,950 --> 00:13:21,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>If you only pity the loser</i></b></font>

174
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:25,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>and do nothing to stop</i>
<i>the decadence of the rich…</i></b></font>

175
00:13:25,950 --> 00:13:27,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>you're just as guilty, Sasuke.</i></b></font>

176
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's just as you said.</b></font>

177
00:13:31,900 --> 00:13:33,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But…</b></font>

178
00:13:34,070 --> 00:13:35,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"But"?</b></font>

179
00:13:35,900 --> 00:13:38,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No, never mind.</b></font>

180
00:13:59,990 --> 00:14:03,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey, you probably won't tell me…</b></font>

181
00:14:03,610 --> 00:14:05,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But I'll ask anyway.</b></font>

182
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:08,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Where are you headed this time?</b></font>

183
00:14:08,650 --> 00:14:09,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hell Valley.</b></font>

184
00:14:09,990 --> 00:14:12,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>See? You didn't tell me…</b></font>

185
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:15,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What? Hell Valley?!</b></font>

186
00:14:15,650 --> 00:14:18,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The one making Exploding Humans
is there?</b></font>

187
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Probably not.</b></font>

188
00:14:22,150 --> 00:14:24,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then why are you going?</b></font>

189
00:14:25,900 --> 00:14:28,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I want to see this Hell Valley
with my own eyes.</b></font>

190
00:14:30,820 --> 00:14:34,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As the last survivor
of the Uchiha Clan.</b></font>

191
00:14:51,530 --> 00:14:52,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Huh?!</b></font>

192
00:14:52,860 --> 00:14:55,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We came all the way here
to the Land of Steam,</b></font>

193
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and we're not gonna soak
in the hot springs?</b></font>

194
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:02,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You two can do
whatever you want.</b></font>

195
00:15:02,490 --> 00:15:04,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is where we go
our separate ways.</b></font>

196
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But why?</b></font>

197
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:11,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The one making
the Exploding Humans is after me.</b></font>

198
00:15:12,950 --> 00:15:15,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's better if
you're not around me.</b></font>

199
00:15:15,950 --> 00:15:17,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We came all the way here together.</b></font>

200
00:15:17,990 --> 00:15:20,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>As if we'd desert you now,
Sasuke dear.</b></font>

201
00:15:21,780 --> 00:15:24,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>We're going with you
to Hell Valley!</b></font>

202
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:57,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Exploding Humans!</b></font>

203
00:15:57,990 --> 00:15:58,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke dear!</b></font>

204
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Stay away!</b></font>

205
00:16:02,030 --> 00:16:04,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Nowaki, let go!</b></font>

206
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:49,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>He's…</i></b></font>

207
00:16:50,070 --> 00:16:51,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>not cloaked in chakra.</i></b></font>

208
00:17:08,900 --> 00:17:11,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hot! So hot...!</b></font>

209
00:17:11,820 --> 00:17:12,400
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hot! So hot!</b></font>

210
00:17:21,860 --> 00:17:24,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're not Fuushin, are you?</b></font>

211
00:17:24,990 --> 00:17:26,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>W-What're you saying?</b></font>

212
00:17:26,820 --> 00:17:28,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm the Lightning Gang's…</b></font>

213
00:17:28,530 --> 00:17:30,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I possess the Sharingan.</b></font>

214
00:17:31,950 --> 00:17:34,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can look into
your memories with this.</b></font>

215
00:17:35,990 --> 00:17:39,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If you're lying, I can't guarantee
that I'll spare you.</b></font>

216
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:42,950
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fine.</b></font>

217
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:50,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Won't guarantee my life?</b></font>

218
00:17:50,990 --> 00:17:54,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Well, I'll say it right back at you!</b></font>

219
00:17:54,950 --> 00:17:56,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Whoa... I won't let you.</b></font>

220
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:58,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Earth Style: Mud Wall!</b></font>

221
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:02,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lava Style: Rubber Wall!</b></font>

222
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:13,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Rubber is strong against
the Lightning Style!</b></font>

223
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:18,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Lava Style: Rubber Sphere!</b></font>

224
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right…</b></font>

225
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:27,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Let's do this!</b></font>

226
00:18:29,990 --> 00:18:30,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It starts now!</b></font>

227
00:18:36,780 --> 00:18:37,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What?!</b></font>

228
00:18:38,070 --> 00:18:40,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then I'll just increase the amount!</b></font>

229
00:18:41,450 --> 00:18:42,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Amaterasu.</b></font>

230
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:48,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>W-What the hell this?!</b></font>

231
00:18:50,450 --> 00:18:51,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I-It won't go out!</b></font>

232
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:53,200
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hot! Hot!</b></font>

233
00:18:53,490 --> 00:18:55,240
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I-I'll tell you anything you want!</b></font>

234
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:58,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll talk! Please let me talk!</b></font>

235
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:01,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So please put out
the flames!</b></font>

236
00:19:01,570 --> 00:19:02,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hot! Hot!</b></font>

237
00:19:02,610 --> 00:19:04,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Kagutsuchi…</b></font>

238
00:19:10,860 --> 00:19:12,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You don't have to talk.</b></font>

239
00:19:23,530 --> 00:19:26,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>"I need your help…Fuushin."</i></b></font>

240
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:29,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Just hold on, Boss!</i></b></font>

241
00:19:32,490 --> 00:19:35,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>So you want me to make</i>
<i>this Sasuke guy think</i></b></font>

242
00:19:35,650 --> 00:19:37,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>that I'm after him?</i></b></font>

243
00:19:54,530 --> 00:19:55,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I figured as much.</b></font>

244
00:19:57,950 --> 00:19:59,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's right.</b></font>

245
00:20:00,900 --> 00:20:02,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That chakra sword was</b></font>

246
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:06,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the same as the chakra sword
you threw at me at Bamboo Village.</b></font>

247
00:20:09,990 --> 00:20:11,780
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Show me what you really look like…</b></font>

248
00:20:12,450 --> 00:20:13,740
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"Really look like"?</b></font>

249
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:16,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's not your real appearance.</b></font>

250
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,700
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Otherwise,</b></font>

251
00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:22,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>you wouldn't have shown yourself
before Old Man Iou in the Bamboo Village.</b></font>

252
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:27,450
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Still, were you that scared
to see En Oyashiro?</b></font>

253
00:20:56,780 --> 00:21:00,990
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Indeed… This is how I really look.</b></font>

254
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fuushin!</b></font>

255
00:22:40,670 --> 00:22:42,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I certainly didn't expect it to be you.

</b></font>

256
00:22:42,790 --> 00:22:45,870
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>People who have Kekkei Genkai
are all special, right?

</b></font>

257
00:22:45,870 --> 00:22:49,210
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Because this power leads to fear,
the rift between people widens

</b></font>

258
00:22:49,290 --> 00:22:51,920
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and they deem you
unpleasant and evil.

</b></font>

259
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:54,790
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll make you tell me
the entire story.

</b></font>

260
00:22:55,580 --> 00:22:58,620
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Before that,
let me blow you up…

</b></font>

261
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:05,170
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"Sasuke's Story: Sunrise, Part 4:
The Ketsuryugan"


</b></font>

262
00:23:05,870 --> 00:23:07,420
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Susano'o!


</b></font>

263
00:23:08,730 --> 00:23:28,580
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tune in again!

</b></font>

